The compatibility layer provides universal representations, preduals,
Kaplansky density, finite normal traces, central decompositions, and properly
infinite projection and isometry structure. The ports use Lean's module system
and a Mathlib prelude for compatibility with the selected toolchain.

Mathlib and its contributors provide the supporting analysis and algebra
library under Apache-2.0. Their notices remain in that dependency.

